<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">Convergence</ansi>

<ansi fg="command">Convergence</ansi> is the Watching Obelisk's great working. Light climbs its facets,
one after another, over several rounds, and when it reaches the peak it
falls on everyone in the room. It spares the Obelisk's own guardians.

<ansi fg="yellow">Counterplay: </ansi>

  The climb is slow and plain to see. Strike the Obelisk hard enough while
  the light is climbing and it may lose its hold. When the Obelisk cracks
  late in the fight it stops holding back, and Convergence comes more
  often.

